# Cloudflare Tunnel connector — copy to .env and paste the tunnel token.
# .env is gitignored — never commit the real value.
#
# Where to get the token (requires a Cloudflare account + a domain added to it;
# full walkthrough in docs/runbooks/cloudflare-tunnel.md):
#   Zero Trust dashboard (https://one.dash.cloudflare.com) → Networks → Tunnels →
#   Create a tunnel (type "Cloudflared") → the token is the long string after
#   `--token` in the install command the dashboard shows.
#   Equivalent CLI: `cloudflared tunnel token <tunnel-name>` (after
#   `cloudflared tunnel login` and `cloudflared tunnel create <tunnel-name>`).
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
